    {
      "text": "真人秀限时冲上监狱屋顶争夺自由",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The only way to shorten this sentence? Win on “The Last Ticket.” The rules are simple: there is a shuttle on the roof of the prison, and if you can fight your way through hordes of other inmates and reach it in time, you will be given your freedom.",
