      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "清版格斗、射击与肉鸽融合的肢解战斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "KIBORG is a hybrid of old-school beat’em ups, shooters, and rogue-likes. The fights are fast, brutal, and deadly. Sever limbs, squash heads, and tear cybernetic cores apart from living foes.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2405060/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "替换身体部件叠加数百强化与数十突变",
      "dimension": "玩法",
